  "suite": "merchant-sign-in",
  "case": "token-errors-normalised",
  "description": "An error from SolvaPay's token or revoke endpoint reaches the client as an RFC 6749 error with the same status. A body that already names a token error code passes through whole; a NestJS body is mapped (401/403 invalid_client, 5xx server_error, then by the validation error's field: grant_type sent but unknown is unsupported_grant_type, missing is invalid_request, code or refresh_token invalid_grant, scope invalid_scope, client credentials invalid_client) and described from the validation errors or the message; a non-JSON body keeps short text as the description. A code outside the token set (unsupported_token_type) is mapped, not passed through.",
